{"data":{"id":"10.48550/arxiv.2604.12931","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.48550/arxiv.2604.12931","prefix":"10.48550","suffix":"arxiv.2604.12931","identifiers":[{"identifier":"2604.12931","identifierType":"arXiv"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"arXiv","alternateIdentifier":"2604.12931"}],"creators":[{"name":"Hu, Jingzhi","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Jingzhi","familyName":"Hu","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]},{"name":"Wang, Ouya","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Ouya","familyName":"Wang","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]},{"name":"Li, Geoffrey Ye","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Geoffrey Ye","familyName":"Li","affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]}],"titles":[{"title":"Token Encoding for Semantic Recovery"}],"publisher":"arXiv","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[{"lang":"en","subject":"Signal Processing (eess.SP)","subjectScheme":"arXiv"},{"lang":"en","subject":"Machine Learning (cs.LG)","subjectScheme":"arXiv"},{"subject":"FOS: Electrical engineering, electronic engineering, information engineering","subjectScheme":"Fields of Science and Technology (FOS)"},{"subject":"FOS: Computer and information sciences","subjectScheme":"Fields of Science and Technology (FOS)"}],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-04-14T16:20:28Z","dateType":"Submitted","dateInformation":"v1"},{"date":"2026-04-15T01:05:50Z","dateType":"Updated","dateInformation":"v1"},{"date":"2026-09-06T00:59:59Z","dateType":"Submitted","dateInformation":"v2"},{"date":"2026-09-09T00:48:54Z","dateType":"Updated","dateInformation":"v2"},{"date":"2026-04","dateType":"Available","dateInformation":"v1"}],"language":null,"types":{"ris":"GEN","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"article","schemaOrg":"CreativeWork","resourceType":"Article","resourceTypeGeneral":"Preprint"},"relatedIdentifiers":[],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":"2","rightsList":[{"rights":"arXiv.org perpetual, non-exclusive license","rightsUri":"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"In generative semantic communication, semantic tokens guide receiver-side generative models to synthesize high-dimensional content. In challenging network environments, however, frequent token erasure distorts the conveyed semantics beyond what receiver-side recovery can restore. In this paper, we propose a token encoding framework (TokCode) for robust semantic recovery, achieving erasure resilience by restructuring redundancy in the semantic domain. TokCode uses a lightweight adapter to recast a general-purpose large language model (LLM) at the transmitter into a token encoder, exploiting the LLM's pretrained semantic prior to avoid introducing a dedicated deep model. To optimize the adapter efficiently and make it applicable across diverse channels, we develop a channel-quality-aware distillation approach for token encoder training~(CADET). Using a differentiable sentence-level semantic surrogate, CADET tunes T5 foundation models into experts for distinct erasure rates and distills them into a single reconfigurable low-rank adapter, enabling subsequent reinforcement learning (RL) to start above the plateau where direct RL stalls. Simulation results on token-based generative image transmission show that TokCode improves the image-level similarity over the best-performing receiver-side recovery benchmark by 14.1%--22.4%, closing 71.9%--76.5% of its gap to the erasure-aware oracle encoding, when only 20% to 50% of the tokens survive.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.12931","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":1,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"mds","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":0,"created":"2026-04-15T02:15:21.000Z","registered":"2026-04-15T02:15:22.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-09-09T06:02:26.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"arxiv.content","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"arxiv","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.48550/arxiv.2604.12931","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[]}}}}